479:<thead><tr><th>那一组</th><th class="num-cell">核心</th><th class="num-cell">辅助</th><th class="num-cell">可选</th><th class="num-cell">要收或可收</th><th class="num-cell">不收</th><th class="num-cell">原列不收、现为可选</th></tr></thead>
